  "transcript": "Mental Model Graph, or M M G, is my ongoing source-code analysis project.\n\nIt turns C plus plus codebases into navigable graphs, helping developers explore components, relationships, tests, and supporting evidence.\n\nI use C plus plus twenty, CMake, Python, and Tree-sitter.\n\nThe project currently runs as a locally built command-line application.\n\nI also created a custom testing framework to keep required behaviours visible and support systematic testing.\n\nA public code example is linked in the project section.",
